ROLE Princess.
ROLE Pretender.

PLAYBOOK Princess:
WHEN greeted:
    DO become_enamoured.
WHEN food_served:
    IF likes(food):
        DO eat_food.
    ELSE:
        DO refuse_food.

PLAYBOOK Pretender:
WHEN food_served:
    DO eat_food.
WHEN asked_to_search:
    DO search_for_food.
    IF finds_food:
        DO give_food_to(Princess).
        SIGNAL food_found.

DURING reception:
    ON ENTER:
        ASSIGN PrincessPlaybook TO Princess.
        ASSIGN GuestPlaybook TO Pretender.
        WORLD DO greet_guests.

DURING feast:
    WHEN food_served:
        IF Princess does_not_like(food):
            Princess DO ask(Pretender, search_for_food).

    WHEN food_found:
        Princess DO eat_food.
